  <data name="HelpText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>EasySave - Backup Management System

Options:
  1. Create a backup job - Add a new backup configuration
  2. List backup jobs - Display all configured backup jobs
  3. Run backups - Execute one or more backup jobs
  4. Delete a backup job - Remove a job (with confirmation)
  5. Edit a backup job - Modify name, paths, type, exclusions
  6. View paths (config and logs) - Show directory for config, state and logs
  7. Help - Show this help message
  0. Quit - Exit the application

When running backups, you can specify job IDs as:
  - Single ID: 1
  - Range: 1-3
  - List: 1,3,5 or 1;3;5</value>
